[2026-06-04T18:36:18.873Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_560","type":"reasoning","text":"**Considering CI Logs**\n\nI’m thinking about whether CI logs can be live. I wonder if using the command `gh run view --log` only shows them after completion, or if they can be streamed live. If they’re huge, that might be a problem, but if they’re long, it could still be manageable. I guess I’ll need to wait and see how this works out. It's a bit tricky, but I’ll figure it out!"}}
